        "content": "#include <stdio.h>\n#define SIZE 8\n\nvoid changeArray(int[], int);\n\nint main()\n{\n  int x[SIZE] = {3, 0, 4, 1, 6, 5, 7, 2};\n  int i;\n  \n  for(i = 0; i <= SIZE / 2; i++) {\n    changeArray(x, x[i]);\n  }\n\n  printf(\"x[4] = %d\\n\", x[4]);\n  \n  return(0); \n}\n\nvoid changeArray(int x[], int val)\n{\n  int i;\n  int j;\n  \n  for(i = 0; i < val; i++)\n  {\n    j = x[i];\n    x[j] += x[j] >= SIZE - 1 ? -1 : 1;\n  }\n}",
